title: Sink3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha's sink (Hotspots layer).
-> Wash up <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and $gate_r1_thu1_sit and not $r1_dishes_started>>
    <<next_scene Route1Dishes>>
-> Keep washing <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and $r1_dishes_started and not $gate_r1_thu1_dishes>>
    <<if $r1_dishes_turn == "">>
        <<set $r1_dishes_turn to "stay">>
    <<endif>>
    <<next_scene Route1DishesEnd>>
-> Turn around <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and $r1_dishes_started and not $gate_r1_thu1_dishes and $r1_dishes_turn == "">>
    <<set $r1_dishes_turn to "turned">>
    <<face Player Samantha>>
    {$samantha_name}: Hm. There he is.
    {$samantha_name}: Back to the plates.
    <<face Player up>>
    <<next_scene Route1DishesEnd>>
-> Take the corkscrew <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and $gate_r1_thu2_shoes and not $gate_r1_thu2_cork>>
    <<set $item_corkscrew to true>>
    <<set $gate_r1_thu2_cork to true>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 sink>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 corkscrew>>
    <<note r1_thu2 "Open the wine at her table.">>
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Thu1" and not $gate_r1_thu1_sit>>
        {$samantha_name}: Dishes come after dinner. Sit down.
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_dinner>>
        {$samantha_name}: Not tonight. Tonight the sink can wait.
    <<else>>
        You: Her sink. Cleaner than mine.
    <<endif>>
===
